  "bodyText": "HUE&CRY\nSERVICES\nABOUT\nCONTACT\n\nHUE&CRY — BRAND & GROWTH STUDIO\n\nMAKE THE\nINTERNET stare.\n\nWe're the marketing agency for brands that refuse to be scrolled past. Strategy, identity, campaigns — built loud, measured properly.\n\nSTART A PROJECT\nSEE SERVICES\nSCROLL\nVELVET STATIC\nKELP & CO.\nNIGHTSHIFT\nFORMA ATHLETICS\nPIGEON POST\nLOUD LUGGAGE\nHEXBRIGHT\nMOONCHECK\nTANDEM & SONS\nOFF-GRID SUPPLY\nVELVET STATIC\nKELP & CO.\nNIGHTSHIFT\nFORMA ATHLETICS\nPIGEON POST\nLOUD LUGGAGE\nHEXBRIGHT\nMOONCHECK\nTANDEM & SONS\nOFF-GRID SUPPLY\n\nWHAT WE DO\n\nSEVEN WAYS TO GET unignored\n01\nPOSITIONING\n→\n02\nIDENTITY\n→\n03\nCAMPAIGNS\n→\n04\nGROWTH\n→\n05\nDIGITAL\n→\n06\nDESIGN\n→\n07\nDEVELOPMENT\n→\n\nTHE LIVE DEMO\n\nYOUR NAME, BUT louder\n\nNo case studies, no before-and-afters. Type your brand into the machine instead — this is roughly what working with us feels like.\n\nSTEP 1 — SAY YOUR NAME\nVOL 1/3\nLOUDER\nYOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●\nYOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●\nYOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●\nYOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●\nYOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●\nYOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●YOUR BRAND●\nLIKE THE SOUND OF THAT? START A PROJECT →\n\nDON'T TAKE OUR WORD FOR IT\n\n“WE WERE THE BEST-KEPT SECRET IN THE CATEGORY. NOW WE'RE THE ONE EVERYONE rips off.”\n\nMARISOL VEGA — CMO, VELVET STATIC\n\nTHE RECEIPTS\n\n0\n\nbrands made unignorable\n\n0M\n\ncampaign impressions last year\n\n0\n\nindustry awards we display loudly\n\n0\n\ncountries shipped to, so far\n\nTHE WHOLE POINT\n\nwe said it politely once. nobody remembered.\n\nSO NOW WE\nSHOUT.\n\n23 DB\n\nNEW BUSINESS\n\nGOT SOMETHING WORTH SHOUTING ABOUT?\nSAY IT LOUD\n\nNEW BUSINESS\n\nSTART A PROJECT\n→\n\nFIND US\n\nLos Angeles\nNew York\nSan Juan\nIstanbul\n\nINDEX\n\nServices\nAbout\nContact\n\nBEHIND THE NOISE\n\nHUE&CRY IS A FICTIONAL AGENCY. THE SITE IS REAL, AND KOTT.STUDIO BUILT IT.\n\nWANT ONE THIS LOUD\n→\n\n© 2026 HUE&CRY Ltd.\n\nMade in kott.studio\n\nHUE&CRY",
